    rd:hasReusabilityScope rd:RS_SubjectSpecific ; rd:hasResolutionEnvironment chx:Env .
chx:CQs a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestionSet ; rdfs:label "Chapter 21 competency questions"@en ; rd:containsCompetencyQuestion chx:CQ1, chx:CQ2 .
chx:CQ1 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which operation of Pillow changes the image it is called on, which returns a new image, and how do the coordinates and box tuples decide what is selected?"@en .
chx:CQ2 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which printed outputs, tables and programs of the chapter differ with current Pillow, Matplotlib and Python, and on what source?"@en .
